{"root_cause": "policy_rejected", "subscriber": "001010000000112", "evidence_frames": [5, 6, 7, 8], "summary": "For IMSI 001010000000112, the gateway sends a Gx CCR-I for APN fleet.example (frame 6). The PCRF answers DIAMETER_AUTHORIZATION_REJECTED, result 5003 (frame 7), and the gateway then returns 'System failure' on the Create Session Response (frame 8). The same thing happens on all four attempts (frames 13-16, 21-24 and 29-32). The other session requests in the capture each get a successful Gx answer (2001).", "customer_reply": "The gateway is not broken. When your moved SIM (001010000000112) tries to connect on the fleet.example APN, the gateway asks our policy server (PCRF) for permission. The policy server refuses with 'authorization rejected'. The gateway then reports that refusal as 'system failure'. SIMs you did not move get a successful policy answer, so they keep working. Most likely the Fleet Pro plan or its policy profile is missing or incorrect for these SIMs on the policy server. We are sending this to our policy team to check the Fleet Pro profile and the SIM assignment. Please do not replace the SIMs."}
```

